  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 3613.77,
      "e": 3615.63,
      "text": "<b>I was gonna say if</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3615.63,
      "e": 3617.13,
      "text": "<b>you're laying here, I get it.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3618.17,
      "e": 3618.93,
      "text": "<b>Complex.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3621.37,
      "e": 3623.13,
      "text": "<b>[LAUGH] Okay.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4043.5,
      "e": 4044.6,
      "text": "<b>You know, feeling presses</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4044.6,
      "e": 4046.47,
      "text": "<b>upon us not to step on this.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4046.47,
      "e": 4047.2,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4047.8,
      "e": 4049.93,
      "text": "<b>What, don't stop me here.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4050.23,
      "e": 4050.97,
      "text": "<b>There we go.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4050.97,
      "e": 4051.53,
      "text": "<b>Hi.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4051.73,
      "e": 4052.03,
      "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4052.23,
      "e": 4053.03,
      "text": "<b>Or so do that, it's</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4053.03,
      "e": 4053.97,
      "text": "<b>more of an action shot.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4054.07,
      "e": 4054.9,
      "text": "<b>Yeah, there you go.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4055.03,
      "e": 4055.37,
      "text": "<b>There you go.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4056.2,
      "e": 4057.47,
      "text": "<b>And you guys supposed to hold your helmet</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4057.47,
      "e": 4058.57,
      "text": "<b>under the other arm, but you didn't.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4058.57,
      "e": 4059.53,
      "text": "<b>Oh, I don't have it.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4059.9,
      "e": 4060.27,
      "text": "<b>Yeah.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4060.9,
      "e": 4061.63,
      "text": "<b>It'll make you have it.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4061.63,
      "e": 4062.1,
      "text": "<b>There you go.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4063.03,
      "e": 4063.13,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4063.3,
      "e": 4063.63,
      "text": "<b>All right.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4063.73,
      "e": 4064.6,
      "text": "<b>I'm all here for you.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4064.63,
      "e": 4065.47,
      "text": "<b>You want your hero shot?</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4065.5,
      "e": 4066.6,
      "text": "<b>He brought your helmet, so</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4066.6,
      "e": 4067.73,
      "text": "<b>you're gonna have to go back up.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4067.87,
      "e": 4068.57,
      "text": "<b>Yeah, totally.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4068.77,
      "e": 4068.97,
      "text": "<b>Oh.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4069.73,
      "e": 4069.83,
      "text": "<b>Other way?</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4069.93,
      "e": 4070.33,
      "text": "<b>Hold him, Maverick.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4070.8,
      "e": 4071.0,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4071.2,
      "e": 4071.93,
      "text": "<b>All right.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4072.23,
      "e": 4073.17,
      "text": "<b>That looks more natural.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4073.17,
      "e": 4074.1,
      "text": "<b>That looks like what's going on.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4076.37,
      "e": 4076.8,
      "text": "<b>(laughing) Good.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4077.47,
      "e": 4078.07,
      "text": "<b>We got you.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4078.43,
      "e": 4079.77,
      "text": "<b>Okay, well, you know,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4079.83,
      "e": 4080.67,
      "text": "<b>as long as we've got</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4080.67,
      "e": 4081.73,
      "text": "<b>all our social media.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4083.77,
      "e": 4083.83,
      "text": "<b>Take the chair off.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4083.83,
      "e": 4084.67,
      "text": "<b>Yeah, get in there, Jim.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4088.3,
      "e": 4088.53,
      "text": "<b>All right.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4089.7,
      "e": 4090.57,
      "text": "<b>Congratulations.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4093.6,
      "e": 4093.87,
      "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4094.17,
      "e": 4094.57,
      "text": "<b>All right.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4094.57,
      "e": 4095.53,
      "text": "<b>It's not your first rodeo.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4095.53,
      "e": 4096.8,
      "text": "<b>And I'll leave you with Tim,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4096.8,
      "e": 4097.7,
      "text": "<b>because Tim's your</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4097.7,
      "e": 4098.8,
      "text": "<b>pilot, so I'm out of the way.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4098.8,
      "e": 4099.5,
      "text": "<b>Tim's my pilot.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4100.47,
      "e": 4100.7,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4101.13,
      "e": 4101.33,
      "text": "<b>Thank you.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4102.53,
      "e": 4103.5,
      "text": "<b>So, are you ready for the front seat?</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4104.07,
      "e": 4105.43,
      "text": "<b>I don't know if I'm quite</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4105.53,
      "e": 4105.77,
      "text": "<b>ready for the front seat.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4105.77,
      "e": 4106.73,
      "text": "<b>Oh, come on.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4107.5,
      "e": 4108.4,
      "text": "<b>(laughing) But thank you.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4109.27,
      "e": 4110.23,
      "text": "<b>That's very nice.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4110.53,
      "e": 4111.57,
      "text": "<b>Do I have to hold this anymore?</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4111.57,
      "e": 4111.8,
      "text": "<b>We'll put this down.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4112.4,
      "e": 4113.43,
      "text": "<b>Yes, let's do that.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4113.43,
      "e": 4113.9,
      "text": "<b>Keep it nice.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4113.93,
      "e": 4115.0,
      "text": "<b>I feel like I just saw a</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4115.0,
      "e": 4116.13,
      "text": "<b>Brad flick in the corner.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4116.47,
      "e": 4116.7,
      "text": "<b>You did?</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4116.77,
      "e": 4117.1,
      "text": "<b>Brad flick.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4117.6,
      "e": 4118.43,
      "text": "<b>It wasn't my imagination.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4119.7,
      "e": 4119.97,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4120.03,
      "e": 4121.07,
      "text": "<b>All right, let's get a couple more.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4121.1,
      "e": 4122.07,
      "text": "<b>I'm going with more photos.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4125.1,
      "e": 4126.03,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4126.2,
      "e": 4127.13,
      "text": "<b>Okay, move, Tim.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4127.7,
      "e": 4128.37,
      "text": "<b>Now Tim's out.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4129.17,
      "e": 4129.7,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4130.53,
      "e": 4131.2,
      "text": "<b>Oh my.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4131.2,
      "e": 4132.17,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4132.3,
      "e": 4135.3,
      "text": "<b>You missed a lot of it.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4135.57,
      "e": 4137.6,
      "text": "<b>I think you got yourself one.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4138.4,
      "e": 4140.2,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4140.3,
      "e": 4141.1,
      "text": "<b>That was an error.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4142.0,
      "e": 4144.27,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4144.6,
      "e": 4145.23,
      "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4146.53,
      "e": 4148.57,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4148.77,
      "e": 4149.6,
      "text": "<b>All righty.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4150.87,
      "e": 4151.5,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4151.5,
      "e": 4152.37,
      "text": "<b>I won't hug you.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4152.67,
      "e": 4152.87,
      "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4154.33,
      "e": 4155.27,
      "text": "<b>(laughing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4155.27,
      "e": 4155.87,
      "text": "<b>Thank you.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4157.43,
      "e": 4157.73,
      "text": "<b>(chattering)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4159.53,
      "e": 4161.3,
      "text": "<b>So no, it was great.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4161.3,
      "e": 4163.1,
      "text": "<b>We had a wonderful flight.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4163.1,
      "e": 4164.03,
      "text": "<b>It was super fun.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4164.3,
      "e": 4165.1,
      "text": "<b>There was a bug</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4165.1,
      "e": 4166.57,
      "text": "<b>inside the canopy with me.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4167.4,
      "e": 4169.0,
      "text": "<b>Not exactly quite sure why</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4169.0,
      "e": 4170.27,
      "text": "<b>the bug wanted to ride along,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4170.27,
      "e": 4171.6,
      "text": "<b>but it did and that was good.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4172.6,
      "e": 4174.2,
      "text": "<b>But the flight was fun.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4174.27,
      "e": 4175.37,
      "text": "<b>It was supersonic.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4175.77,
      "e": 4177.2,
      "text": "<b>We had five Gs,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4177.5,
      "e": 4179.5,
      "text": "<b>which I don't need to have five Gs</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4179.53,
      "e": 4181.2,
      "text": "<b>on any kind of regular basis.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4183.0,
      "e": 4183.43,
      "text": "<b>I don't know.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4183.5,
      "e": 4185.33,
      "text": "<b>But we had fun in Tim's awesome pilot.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4185.77,
      "e": 4186.9,
      "text": "<b>And a great tour guide.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4187.37,
      "e": 4189.1,
      "text": "<b>Saw a lot of the area.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 4190.17,
      "e": 4190.7,
      "text": "<b>How's that?</b>"
    }
